confirm.description:
The API token of the project “{project}” ({url}) expires on {when} (days left: {days}); the automatic renewal failed: {detail}

“Fix” tries again. If that does not work, create a new token in Semaphore yourself and enter it under “Re-authenticate”. When the token expires the devices are “unavailable”.

A new token is created with the current one (same lifetime), checked and adopted. The old token stays in Semaphore and expires by itself. Address: {url}, project: “{project}”.
